webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;outline: 0px;" mpa-font-style="mtjy2cz18bk" data-mpa-action-id="mtjy2cz95az" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;">雷峰网·鲸犀：你们会现场或直播展示吗？</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;visibility: visible;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">王志宇：有。我们 9 月 5 号参加德国的展会，有在现场直播，也邀请了很多网红到现场看机器。</span></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvaun7ss1gib"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="muf8tesq1b7f" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline: 0px;text-align: justify;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 40px 0em 32px;outline: 0px;"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 10px 0em 20px;outline: 0px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0em;padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;border-left: 5px solid rgb(68, 153, 231);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: flex-start;"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: -2px 0em -3px;outline: 0px;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-trav