e-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: normal;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;font-weight: bolder;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.5px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mv7upbl7pev" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Git 已经支撑软件开发二十多年，Anthropic 却决定把它换掉。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为了让 Claude 持续生成的代码顺利进入开发流程，7 名工程师花了 5 个月，开发出版本控制系统 Scion，并将核心代码仓库迁移过去。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">今年 5 月，Anthropic 每天平均合并约 2500 项代码变更，到 9 月已超过 3 万项，仅 CI 系统每天就要执行约 2500 万次代码检出。写代码的速度上来了，准备仓库、同步对象和查询历史却越来越费机器。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;662bfcdf-3833-47be-9ea4-380c7388e8d9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:642,&quot;width&quot;:2358,&quot;currHeight&quot;:642,&quot;currWidth&quot;:2358,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:642,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:2358,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAEotb6JwIohkrFxUrfxcXDuxnRg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AEotb6JwIohkrFxUrfxcXDuxnRg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:145319,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0e32c66.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.2722222222222222" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="2358" data-height="642" data-backw="546" data-backh="149" data-imgfileid="100263455" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0e32c66.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">几乎同一时期，GitHub 用微调后的 ModernBERT 替换密钥扫描中的通用 LLM 判断。哥伦比亚大学与 Google DeepMind 等机构则通过 BTTF，把芯片仿真波形转换成 SQLite，让 Agent 使用 SQL 排查异常。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Scion 默认在线，BTTF 将波形变成查询接口，GitHub 把高频判断交给分类器。围绕人类开发节奏设计的系统，开始承受 Agent 带来的另一种负载。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv7usonj85s"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0e69eb9.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0e69eb9.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">Git 的离线能力，为什么成了负担</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Git 的分布式设计让工程师克隆仓库后，即使断网也能提交、合并、查看历史。但 Anthropic 大量读取代码的任务是始终联网的 CI 作业和 Agent 沙箱，运行几分钟便销毁，可能只需要几个文件、一份 diff，或确认两个提交的祖先关系。为了这些操作准备本地仓库，重复成本越来越高。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 主分支历史接近 100 GB，压缩工作副本超过 25 GB。若每天 2500 万次检出分别获取完整副本，理论流量会超过 600 PB。公司虽用浅克隆、稀疏检出、快照和数百台 Git 镜像，但镜像仍要同步、快照会过期，历史查询还需补齐对象。仓库越活跃，维护成本越高。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;078521b2-20af-4632-82f5-c11e2de90778&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1238,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1238,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1238,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FPsf0bX9maoydzoxd9khcd8l4nrg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Psf0bX9maoydzoxd9khcd8l4nrg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:504921,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0e90582.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.32222222222222224" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3840" data-height="1238" data-backw="546" data-backh="176" data-imgfileid="100263456" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0e90582.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Scion 将客户端缩成轻量入口。提交创建、合并、变基与历史查询放到中心服务，本地仅监测文件变化、维护少量缓存，需要工作目录时按需展开。CI 若只想计算 diff，可以直接调用 API，无须完整检出。这牺牲了离线自治，却减少重复初始化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">提交格式也变了。Git commit 指向描述仓库状态的目录树，Scion 的 changeset 则以预写日志条目记录相对首个父提交修改过的文件，通过内容寻址指针引用数据。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">创建 changeset 无须生成 Git packfile，也不用立即移动共享分支，只有 main 等引用更新时，系统才对 Spanner 中的单行记录执行 compare-and-swap。Agent 可以并发生成变更，竞争集中到分支引用移动时。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7390922a-0456-481a-90e8-ad591f047d20&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1718,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1718,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1718,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYpJibvMkSoXmyWx4fHKcMgBDneg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YpJibvMkSoXmyWx4fHKcMgBDneg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:742447,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0eb99fe.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.44722222222222224" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3840" data-height="1718" data-backw="546" data-backh="244" data-imgfileid="100263457" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0eb99fe.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但历史查询仍有难题：增量记录无法直接回答某行是谁改的、文件经历过什么。Scion 为 blame、路径历史与提交图跳表维护 derived data，按父提交关系预计算，或等查询发生后再生成。写入与历史分析可以独立扩展。雷峰网</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">检出时，scn 客户端从目标目录树开始，只请求缺失的 tree 和 blob。请求依次经过节点上的 scion-daemon、区域 scion-cache，再由 scion-server 回源到 Spanner 或对象存储。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;44d8e979-d289-4cc3-93d7-b2ea1da2a4a4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;currHeight&quot;:2160,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:2160,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVIdebGtFco83pWxoHBHcm47FnGg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VIdebGtFco83pWxoHBHcm47FnGg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:936317,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0ee74db.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.562962962962963" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3840" data-height="2160" data-backw="546" data-backh="307" data-imgfileid="100263458" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0ee74db.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对象写入后不可变，缓存能够跨任务复用，减少协商、压缩及反复传输。Anthropic 称缓存命中率超过 99%，并限制故障时的回源流量。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">迁移后，Scion 相较旧 Git 镜像体系的 CPU 和内存需求约缩小 200 倍，检出从分钟级降至秒级，CI 释放约 25% 的 CPU 容量。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">200 倍说的是基础设施资源占用，并非 Git 操作整体提速。Anthropic 还同步建设 Antique 代码评审、源码搜索、IAM 和批量合并工具，以适配新协议。在线服务的维护也成了新成本。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;30c1762e-854d-478c-9bb2-252b2cf7f48b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2995,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;currHeight&quot;:2995,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:2995,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FX9iwbh9qDoHncixi3OwcSPTNnEb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;X9iwbh9qDoHncixi3OwcSPTNnEb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1367770,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0f210f3.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7796296296296297" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3840" data-height="2995" data-backw="546" data-backh="426" data-imgfileid="100263459" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0f210f3.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv7ut40pe56"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0f544d0.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0f544d0.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">让数据库读波形，Agent 才能追查故障</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">芯片验证面对的是另一种障碍。RTL 仿真产生的 VCD、FSDB 波形记录大量信号随时间变化的状态，复杂设计的转储可能达到数十 GB，甚至 TB 级。雷峰网</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工程师可以在波形查看器里沿时间轴寻找异常，Agent 若把原始波形转换成文本，上下文很快便被时间戳、信号名和重复跳变占满。追查其他信号，还可能重复读取文件。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">另外，人类习惯用眼睛在图表里“大海捞针”，但 Agent 再大的上下文也装不下几十 GB 的物理文件。因此，将这些“死文件”转化为可被 SQL 精准调用的“活接口”，是给 AI 喂数据的最优解。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">BTTF 把数据访问交给 SQLite。signal_metadata 保存信号名称、类型和层级等静态信息，signal_changes 记录信号 ID、时间戳和变化后的值，两表通过 ID 关联。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c0a04860-ca4c-427d-9a96-34c47930d42d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:972,&quot;width&quot;:1720,&quot;currHeight&quot;:972,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1720,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:972,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1720,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FL6IibariAoEw8lxQDpScxpBAnbg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;L6IibariAoEw8lxQDpScxpBAnbg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:710897,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0f8d4d7.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5648148148148148" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1720" data-height="972" data-backw="546" data-backh="308" data-imgfileid="100263463" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0f8d4d7.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">查询某条信号在指定时刻的状态，SQL 找到该时刻之前最近的变化记录，要检查一段时间内的翻转，则按时间窗过滤与聚合。两次跳变之间状态不变，不能把没有新记录误当作未知。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">模型只需处理问题与少量返回事件。比如某段握手协议超时，Agent 可以先检索请求与响应信号的变化，再缩小到异常区间，检查时序关系。数据库负责检索，模型决定下一步查什么。查询需对齐信号 ID、时间单位与 RTL 版本。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但把波形搬进数据库，并不会自动消除压力。高频时钟产生密集记录，逐行 INSERT 又有事务成本。BTTF 在摄取时建立波形标识到数据库 ID 的映射，统计信号跳变，结合时钟过滤、无跳变信号裁剪和批量插入。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1d22e8ae-8748-4954-a383-fe0c99aab4fa&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1002,&quot;width&quot;:1416,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1002,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1416,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1002,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1416,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGZzjbMbW0opoMnx4WGvcCHQAnmd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GZzjbMbW0opoMnx4WGvcCHQAnmd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:716348,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0fd70b0.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7074074074074074" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1416" data-height="1002" data-backw="546" data-backh="386" data-imgfileid="100263460" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c0fd70b0.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">未裁剪数据库占用 1420 MB，查询约耗时 410.5 毫秒，过滤时钟和无跳变信号后，规模降到 395 MB，耗时降至 94.8 毫秒。若继续删除跳变率低于平均水平的信号，数据库能缩至 185 MB，但活动覆盖率只剩 64.23%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">罕见故障可能恰好出现在几乎不翻转的控制信号上。数据在导入阶段被删除，后面的 Agent 就无法恢复证据。裁剪要服从断言与调试需求。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">有了 SQL 接口，BTTF 再安排不同 Agent 分工：Orchestration Agent 拆解任务，Analysis Agent 生成查询，Verification Agent 检查断言并关联 RTL 源码，Evaluation Agent 核查时间范围、字段关系与结果完整性。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;bd19d585-2e70-4b5d-a926-7d6deb56003c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:522,&quot;width&quot;:1636,&quot;currHeight&quot;:522,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1636,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:522,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1636,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKBoTb1NYaoFlvHxEUd2cOzusnHe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KBoTb1NYaoFlvHxEUd2cOzusnHe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:267062,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c1013e57.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3194444444444444" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1636" data-height="522" data-backw="546" data-backh="174" data-imgfileid="100263462" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c1013e57.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">例如 ASSERT_KNOWN 发现信号出现 X/Z 未知状态，系统先锁定违规时刻，再向前检查相关操作数的状态，逐步定位可能的模块。SQL 出错还可以修正后继续。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">研究团队在 4.2 GB 波形、18450 个信号和 150 条专家标注查询的实验中，取得 95.33% 的执行准确率。Multi-Agent 质量评分比单 Agent 提高 17.3%，平均延迟也增至约 1.96 倍，静态 SVA 检查准确率为 84.62%。方案可支持后仿真分析，但持续摄取与复杂归因仍需验证。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv7utkby1f2k"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c104da23.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c104da23.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">为什么密钥扫描换回了分类器</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">高熵字符串可能是真实凭据，也可能是测试数据、占位符或校验和。正则表达式能快速找到可疑格式，却不擅长判断代码上下文，通用 LLM 可以帮助区分，但候选越多，推理费用和延迟便不断累积。对于需要在代码提交被接受前给出结果的 Push Protection，这种等待会直接影响开发体验。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">GitHub 保留正则作为候选入口，将后续判断交给微调后的 ModernBERT。它读取候选字符串、密钥类型、变量名、文件路径和附近代码，输出风险分类得分，再由阈值决定是否告警。编码器经过前向计算就能返回类别，不需要像生成式 LLM 那样逐 token 输出解释，适合批量处理同类请求。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c5da91f1-7e12-43b3-b048-351cd1a9b3d9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:914,&quot;width&quot;:1334,&quot;currHeight&quot;:914,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1334,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:914,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1334,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEYCDbA9soooJKPxansXcGY6Hn0d%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EYCDbA9soooJKPxansXcGY6Hn0d&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:157740,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c107f93a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6851851851851852" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1334" data-height="914" data-backw="546" data-backh="374" data-imgfileid="100263461" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c107f93a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">难点在于 hard negatives：字符串很像密钥，却是无害示例。GitHub 将产品反馈及人工标注、真实仓库中的高召回候选、专门合成的困难负样本组合起来，并按仓库、候选值和关联关系划分训练与评估集，减少相似数据带来的评估偏差。否则模型可能记住文件名，却难以辨认陌生项目中的凭据。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">部署时，模型导出为 ONNX 并进行 8 位量化，以降低推理资源开销。阈值还需要结合 Precision、Recall 与线上流量校准：太宽松会带来误报，过于严格则可能放过真实密钥。出现新密钥格式时，还需更新训练集和规则。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">相较旧 LLM 管线，新方案的离线 Precision 提高 13%，Recall 提高 19%。线上 A/B 实验显示，Post-push 扫描执行时间中位数下降 86%，模型服务成本下降超过 98%，按仓库所有者加权的告警接受指标提高 11.5%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这里 98% 指模型服务费用，并非整套安全系统的总成本。分类器也只能判断正则找到的候选，前置规则的覆盖范围仍限制漏报表现。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">规则发现线索，分类器完成判断，开放式分析仍可交给通用 LLM，避免每次固定判断承担生成式推理成本。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv7uu1mc1b0z"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c10b1804.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c10b1804.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">04</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">接下来可能轮到 CI</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">GitHub 缩短了安全扫描的反馈时间，代码接下来仍要经过构建、测试和部署。Anthropic 在解决源码检出问题后，也遇到了新的麻烦：一轮测试尚未结束，主分支可能又合入数百甚至数千项修改。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">继续依赖全局锁会让变更不断积压，放开并发又会带来新的风险，即便某次测试已经通过，它对应的代码状态也可能与准备部署的版本出现差异。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这意味着 CI 接下来要处理的，是验证结果如何在高频变更中保持有效。构建缓存需要识别源码与依赖关系的变化，测试记录必须关联具体提交和构建产物，系统还要判断哪些结果能够复用、哪些修改会使此前的验证失效。对于依赖关系复杂的 Monorepo，仅仅增加测试机器，很难解决并发修改带来的版本一致性问题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;eb06d6e5-a123-4ab2-af69-6da1e9507400&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;currHeight&quot;:2160,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:2160,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3840,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUXqfbXIgQoSnaVx42TGcFDPBnch%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;UXqfbXIgQoSnaVx42TGcFDPBnch&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1061273,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c10dee81.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.562962962962963" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3840" data-height="2160" data-backw="546" data-backh="307" data-imgfileid="100263464" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c10dee81.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 已经开始强化合并后测试与部署前验证。对普通团队而言，先完善依赖分析、增量测试和构建缓存，比直接重建版本控制系统更现实。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">随着 Agent 持续提高代码产出，软件工程的瓶颈还会沿着交付链路向后移动。代码进入主分支的速度可以越来越快，但构建、测试与部署之间必须保留可靠的验证关系。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">未来可能会有越来越多的例子说明，</span><strong style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">AI 写代码的狂飙突进，最终倒逼着整条软件工程流水线被迫“重做一遍”。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工程基础设施的价值，也将更多体现在能否让高速变化的代码持续获得可信的交付依据。</span></section><section style="text-align: left;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-mpa-action-id="mv7uqrrbhps" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><em><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mv7uqrr31xcm"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">参考链接：</span></span></em><em><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mv7uqrr3r4e"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/redesigning-source-control</span></span></em></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c1109aea.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/cNFA8C0uVPtkbNicD8I2GvtPB7zOabgtL47FMpic1WWjHrvb7HCcxSsia7AQvQhsfvGnZ9dKYlozpP4W6j20sV2wQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="223" data-imgfileid="100236545" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c1109aea.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mpzpilb31bbr"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;" data-mpa-action-id="mp0lz1ofco1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;width: 677px;transform: rotate(0deg);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;width: 50px;height: 4px;background-color: rgb(68, 153, 231);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;" mpa-from-tpl="t"></svg></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: -4px;padding: 10px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">上车，带你看遍全球 AI 顶会精华</span></span></strong></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg2nab13jb"></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 8px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">可独家畅览：</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">专家演讲PPT</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">大会报告全文</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">热门论文解读</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">学术新星访谈</span></span></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg35eosx9"></span><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c1143495.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafMqpEPibJ4AOibc6RBL778iaiciaVgquCMrS14ia0XmXfw3YAU5iaSJzBYQOBMNGlM0ic387w7rB6QnU0PO9KPyGqXc8vu6ib2OlB3QIIIQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="546" data-imgfileid="100262550" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59c1143495.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">或点击</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">「</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">阅读原文</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">」</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">关注专区。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><span data-lark-record-format="docx/record"></span></section><section><span data-mpa-action-id="mipr37w01zjd"></span></section>]]></description>
