text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Meta 刚发布的 Muse Wonder，没想到因为一盏熔岩灯，在开发者社区引发了一场关于 AI 模型跑分的争论。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">10 月 12 日，Meta 推出 Muse Wonder 和 Muse Wonder Full，主打 Coding Agent、工具调用和长任务执行能力。官方公布的成绩相当亮眼，Wonder Full 在 SWE-Marathon 上拿到 57.5 分，DeepSWE 1.1 达到 79.0 分，已经能够与同期的前沿模型展开竞争。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">然而，开发者社区 BridgeMind 随后安排了一项 3D 编程测试，要求 Muse Wonder 制作一盏具有透明玻璃外壳、动态熔岩和光照效果的熔岩灯。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">结果模型只生成了一个红色圆柱体。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5a3cb4b2-c801-4737-89a2-6d0335c450a1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1249,&quot;width&quot;:1163,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1249,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1163,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1249,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1163,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCLrtbjgWyomHDixMlEpc8FA1nj9%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CLrtbjgWyomHDixMlEpc8FA1nj9&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:513247,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b320b939.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0739466895958727" data-type="png" data-w="1163" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1163" data-height="1249" data-backw="546" data-backh="586" data-imgfileid="100263370" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b320b939.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">BridgeMind 随即质疑 Muse Wonder 存在严重的 Benchmaxxing，也就是针对 Benchmark 进行大量优化，成绩看着漂亮，碰上陌生任务却露了怯。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">连马斯克也忍不住下场，在相关帖子下意味深长地回了一句 Hmm。短短一个词，虽然没有明确表态，却让这场围绕 Meta 新模型的刷分争议又添了几分戏剧性。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ed4e0e18-a70b-46d1-a455-8ae9f43d03d1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1008,&quot;width&quot;:1178,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1008,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1178,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1008,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1178,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCdvnbQODrohKnmxqL2UceJ1Cnre%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CdvnbQODrohKnmxqL2UceJ1Cnre&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:261352,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b32391c2.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8556876061120543" data-type="png" data-w="1178" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1178" data-height="1008" data-backw="546" data-backh="467" data-imgfileid="100263368" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b32391c2.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Meta 首席 AI 官 Alexandr Wang 很快回应，团队确实没有针对 3D 演示游戏进行显式训练，事后看来或许应该补充相关训练，但他仍然希望开发者实际体验 Muse Wonder 的 Coding 能力。雷峰网</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这场争论有一个重要前提：熔岩灯测试针对的是普通版 Muse Wonder，而 Meta 公布的部分突出成绩来自 Wonder Full，两者存在能力差异。同时，Meta 官方 Model Card 已经明确承认，视觉与空间推理，尤其是 3D 任务，属于 Muse Wonder 的已知短板。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0f921617-8835-4065-a5be-caef5d11fffd&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:800,&quot;width&quot;:1174,&quot;currHeight&quot;:800,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1174,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:800,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1174,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVqmCbrAhHoi1KYxtOTscnviBnQc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VqmCbrAhHoi1KYxtOTscnviBnQc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:164839,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b326ec81.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6814310051107325" data-type="png" data-w="1174" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1174" data-height="800" data-backw="546" data-backh="372" data-imgfileid="100263369" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b326ec81.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但高分模型在陌生任务中遭遇如此明显的失败，依然让人好奇：当前大模型的训练方法究竟在强化哪些能力，Agent Benchmark 又能在多大程度上反映模型的实际水平？</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6cjrya1e5e"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b32a9d6b.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b32a9d6b.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">奖励机制，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">决定模型擅长解决什么问题</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Muse Wonder 的表现，与当前大模型越来越依赖 Post-training 提升任务能力的技术路线有关。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在 Pre-training 阶段，模型通过大规模数据学习语言、代码、空间关系和其他通用知识。进入 Post-training 后，训练会进一步塑造模型的行为策略，尤其是通过强化学习，让它在特定任务环境中形成更稳定的执行能力。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Coding Agent 很适合这类训练。例如，给模型一个存在 Bug 的代码仓库，要求它定位问题、修改文件并运行测试。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">整个过程可以通过编译结果、单元测试和功能检查获得相对明确的反馈。强化学习系统据此判断哪些操作有效，持续强化能够提高任务成功率的行为。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">训练规模扩大后，模型逐渐学会一套复杂的软件工程策略，包括如何缩小搜索范围、选择工具、处理报错，以及在多轮修改中维护任务状态。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6c1d40d9-9aea-48dd-baba-d18254ab0c6e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNhGwbZnntoxJ1RxPIGac90R2n5g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NhGwbZnntoxJ1RxPIGac90R2n5g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:656927,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b32d388d.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="546" data-imgfileid="100263372" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b32d388d.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Meta 在官方技术文章中提到，Muse Wonder 接受了多样化长任务训练，并引入 Active Focus，使模型能够在遭遇阻碍后尝试其他方案、恢复执行并继续推进任务。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但这类训练依赖一个关键条件：环境必须能够向模型提供有用的反馈。熔岩灯恰好打破了传统 Coding Agent 熟悉的反馈方式。雷峰网</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">从程序实现来看，熔岩灯涉及三维几何、透明材质、光照计算和动态形变。如果使用 Three.js，模型需要构造玻璃灯罩，为内部熔岩生成不规则的几何形态，再通过时间变量或噪声函数驱动形状变化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这些代码即使能够正常执行，画面仍然可能完全错误。例如，透明材质的参数配置不当，玻璃就可能变成不透明的实体，熔岩形状缺少连续变化机制，内部效果就可能退化为静态色块。编译器和单元测试很难直接判断这些视觉问题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这意味着，Agent 还需要具备一套视觉反馈机制，通过渲染截图、识别画面偏差，再把视觉问题转换成代码修改。单纯增加工具调用次数或延长推理时间，并不能替代这一环节。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Muse Wonder 生成红色圆柱体的具体原因，仍然需要完整执行轨迹才能确定。可能是模型没有建立正确的空间结构，也可能是图形工具使用不当，或者生成错误后缺少有效的视觉检查。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Alexandr Wang 承认没有针对 3D 演示进行显式训练，至少说明这一任务没有获得与重点 Coding 场景相同的训练投入。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6ckvgv1jed"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33162da.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33162da.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">Agent 的高分，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">已包含型之外的系统能力</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Muse Wonder 的争议还有一层容易被忽略的问题：今天的 Agent Benchmark，已经无法简单理解为给语言模型出题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">以 SWE-Marathon 为例，它考察的是持续性软件工程任务。模型需要在代码仓库中执行多个操作，读取文件、调用终端、修改代码，并通过测试验证结果。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;937b3270-3369-4e7a-9405-03ef65130e49&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSj3pbcbWAoDqAWxqaf8czGiKn6b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Sj3pbcbWAoDqAWxqaf8czGiKn6b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:726551,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3351874.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="546" data-imgfileid="100263371" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3351874.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这类任务的完成率，除了依赖底层模型，还会受到 Harness 的直接影响。Harness 是围绕模型构建的执行框架，负责组织工具接口、管理上下文、保存任务状态，以及处理执行过程中的异常。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">例如，一个 Agent 正在修复复杂的软件问题，连续运行测试后产生了数千行终端日志。如果系统将全部日志直接追加到上下文中，模型可能逐渐失去对原始需求和关键错误的把握。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">设计更完善的 Harness 可以自动提取重要报错、压缩无效信息，并维护当前修改进度。当任务执行时间延长，这种上下文管理能力会直接影响系统能否持续工作。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;315a7edf-3ca6-4e7e-9ec0-325824ed8e80&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FX3AxbYQGpoCpJqxG624cp5ZCnCf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;X3AxbYQGpoCpJqxG624cp5ZCnCf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:833276,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33903c0.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="546" data-imgfileid="100263376" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33903c0.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">错误恢复机制同样如此。假设 Agent 已经修改了多个文件，却在后续测试中发现早期修改存在问题。如果执行系统能够保留检查点、定位引入错误的步骤，并局部回滚，就有机会避免重新执行整条任务链。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">此外，推理预算也会影响成绩。允许 Agent 使用更多 Token、执行更多工具调用，或者尝试多个候选方案，相当于增加了搜索空间和纠错机会，代价则是更高的运行成本。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Meta 官方 Model Card 对此有明确说明。在 SWE-Marathon 评测中，GPT-6 Astra 和 Claude Fable 5.1 分别使用 Codex 与 Claude Code 执行系统，因此这一项目并非统一 Harness 条件下的受控比较。Muse Wonder Full 的 57.5 分还使用了 xhigh 推理档位。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f6aeddf5-a0f8-4e75-b7c1-a097043eeb16&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGekEbVXAmonZIGxlj6Kcp1Ckn3d%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GekEbVXAmonZIGxlj6Kcp1Ckn3d&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:646423,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33b9a7e.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="546" data-imgfileid="100263374" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33b9a7e.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这些配置差异不会自动使成绩失效，却会影响成绩的解释方式。如果要比较基础模型的推理与规划能力，就需要尽可能统一工具环境、Harness 和推理预算。但如果比较的是能够投入生产的 Coding Agent 产品，完整执行系统的表现本身就具有工程价值。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对于实际开发者而言，Agent 能否稳定处理长任务，往往比单轮生成代码的质量更有意义。问题在于，当各种系统配置被压缩成排行榜上的一个分数时，外部很难判断成绩增长究竟来自模型推理能力、执行框架优化，还是更充足的计算资源。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;225de44d-66dd-450d-aa74-09b11e176bdf&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHa4ebdPZmoTisAxobbsc9wa2nGW%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Ha4ebdPZmoTisAxobbsc9wa2nGW&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:815846,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33e8c1a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="546" data-imgfileid="100263373" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b33e8c1a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这要求 Agent 评测提供更详细的执行信息，包括任务完成率、Token 消耗、工具调用次数、运行时间以及失败恢复情况，否则相近的 Benchmark 成绩，可能对应完全不同的工程体验。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6clh61nfy"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3426337.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3426337.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">Meta 自己也在研究 Benchmaxxin</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">有意思的是，Muse Wonder 官方技术文章专门设置了 Capabilities That Generalize 章节，讨论的恰好是 Benchmaxxing 背后的问题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Meta 指出，两个模型即使在常见 Benchmark 中取得相似成绩，处理陌生任务的能力仍然可能存在较大差距。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为研究这一现象，团队将测试任务划分为两类：一类是 Post-training 重点优化的 In-distribution 任务，另一类是没有进行针对性优化的 Out-of-distribution 任务。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">研究人员进一步比较 Muse Spark 1.3 与 Muse Wonder Full，在不同推理预算下的表现变化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b00a7f83-35f6-4b8c-818e-60250d79a713&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3750,&quot;width&quot;:5760,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3750,&quot;currWidth&quot;:5760,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3750,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:5760,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKIzrb7u5mo3ISJxBsoYcm3rDnvg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KIzrb7u5mo3ISJxBsoYcm3rDnvg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1862426,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3466173.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.65078125" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="5760" data-height="3750" data-backw="546" data-backh="355" data-imgfileid="100263377" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3466173.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">按照 Meta 公布的实验结果，Wonder Full 在陌生任务上的表现，相比前代模型对应的能力变化趋势有所提升。Meta 认为，这与更强的基础模型有关，基础能力的改善使 Post-training 收益能够更有效地迁移到其他任务。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但这里存在一个评测设计问题：陌生任务究竟陌生到什么程度？对于长期训练代码修复的 Agent，换一个未曾接触过的代码仓库，仍然属于相近的软件工程任务。如果进一步更换编程框架、引入陌生 API，模型就需要重新理解工具环境。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6f952e22-6913-4851-b186-9a00c4ecda31&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFkBybz437ozQm3xdGo4cogr2nJh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FkBybz437ozQm3xdGo4cogr2nJh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:734664,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3490f27.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="546" data-imgfileid="100263375" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3490f27.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">而制作 3D 熔岩灯，除了软件开发，还引入了空间建模、材质渲染和视觉质量判断。它对能力组合提出了更大的变化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">因此，分布外泛化不能只用一个综合平均分来描述。不同任务之间的距离、需要补充的知识，以及评价结果的方法，均会影响模型表现。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b2a4276b-98f9-4051-9511-64148b890410&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:4890,&quot;width&quot;:3240,&quot;currHeight&quot;:4890,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:4890,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3240,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDxuSbthLroLnEAxtwtocikCvnhf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DxuSbthLroLnEAxtwtocikCvnhf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2047891,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b34ccb1a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.508984375" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3240" data-height="4890" data-backw="546" data-backh="824" data-imgfileid="100263380" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b34ccb1a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">判断模型是否存在严重的 Benchmark 过拟合，也需要系统性实验。单个熔岩灯失败只能说明模型没有完成当前任务，无法直接证明它针对公开题库进行了过度优化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">更合理的方法，是在相同执行条件下逐步改变任务分布。例如，先测试模型能否修复陌生仓库中的 Bug，再要求它使用未见过的 API 构建程序，随后加入缺少明确测试脚本的视觉开发任务。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这样既可以观察模型在软件工程内部的能力迁移，也能检查它跨越任务类型时出现的性能变化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ec784648-9ee3-4814-bdcb-50dafecc86bf&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3240,&quot;width&quot;:5760,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;currWidth&quot;:5760,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3240,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:5760,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FL7qSblrfdoUMH2xykuzcMS5Sn4g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;L7qSblrfdoUMH2xykuzcMS5Sn4g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1128289,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b34f362f.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5625" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="5760" data-height="3240" data-backw="546" data-backh="307" data-imgfileid="100263379" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b34f362f.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">评测还可以进一步改变环境约束，例如临时替换工具接口、引入新的错误信息，或者要求 Agent 自行设计验证程序。这些设置能够检验模型面对陌生条件时，是否具备阅读文档、建立方案、验证假设和修正错误的能力。&nbsp;</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对于熔岩灯这样的任务，除了检查最终画面，还应该记录模型是否主动使用截图工具、能否识别材质与几何错误，以及在获得反馈后是否能够作出有效修改。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">相比单纯统计成功率，这类执行轨迹更有助于判断 Agent 的能力缺口，也能够区分知识不足、工具错误和反馈机制失效等不同原因。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">随着公开 Benchmark 越来越成熟，模型研发会持续利用已知任务结构改进训练方法。动态任务、隐藏测试以及更完整的执行过程评估，将成为补充固定排行榜的重要手段。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;15b932cf-3618-4641-af05-1d0ac74c8fb5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:738,&quot;width&quot;:1394,&quot;currHeight&quot;:738,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1394,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:738,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1394,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKTXpb4UrOosM3Wx9YyVch7Wanbb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KTXpb4UrOosM3Wx9YyVch7Wanbb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:140712,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3529389.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5294117647058824" data-type="png" data-w="1394" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1394" data-height="738" data-backw="546" data-backh="289" data-imgfileid="100263378" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3529389.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6cmbgb21aj"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b35608ef.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b35608ef.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">04</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">高分之外，还需要看清能力边界</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Muse Wonder 的熔岩灯失败，无法抹去它在软件工程任务上的进步，也不足以证明 Meta 存在严重刷分行为。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但开发者确实需要重新理解今天的 Agent 成绩。当 Post-training、工具系统和推理预算共同参与能力提升，排行榜上的高分，反映的是一套特定条件下的任务完成表现。它对模型选型具有参考意义，但使用场景越复杂，单一分数能够提供的信息就越有限。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">未来的 Agent 研发仍然会继续强化 Coding、工具调用和长任务执行，但当模型逐渐能够承担独立的软件工程工作时，它需要处理的问题会不断超出既有训练任务的范围。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">届时，能否识别陌生环境中的问题、自行建立有效的验证方法，并通过反馈持续修正执行策略，将直接影响 Agent 可以承担多大范围的实际工作。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">一盏熔岩灯没有给出 Muse Wonder 的完整能力答案，却提供了一个具体的提醒：模型在熟悉任务中取得的成绩，与它在未知环境中能够独立完成的工作，仍然需要分别检验。</span></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3592f70.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/cNFA8C0uVPtkbNicD8I2GvtPB7zOabgtL47FMpic1WWjHrvb7HCcxSsia7AQvQhsfvGnZ9dKYlozpP4W6j20sV2wQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="223" data-imgfileid="100236545" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b3592f70.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mpzpilb31bbr"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;" data-mpa-action-id="mp0lz1ofco1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;width: 677px;transform: rotate(0deg);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;width: 50px;height: 4px;background-color: rgb(68, 153, 231);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;" mpa-from-tpl="t"></svg></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: -4px;padding: 10px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">上车，带你看遍全球 AI 顶会精华</span></span></strong></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg2nab13jb"></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 8px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">可独家畅览：</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">专家演讲PPT</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">大会报告全文</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">热门论文解读</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">学术新星访谈</span></span></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg35eosx9"></span><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b35d3006.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafMqpEPibJ4AOibc6RBL778iaiciaVgquCMrS14ia0XmXfw3YAU5iaSJzBYQOBMNGlM0ic387w7rB6QnU0PO9KPyGqXc8vu6ib2OlB3QIIIQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="546" data-imgfileid="100262550" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad59b35d3006.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">或点击</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">「</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">阅读原文</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;