<item>
<title>特斯拉飞行汽车被质疑是噱头！网友：若是国内厂商，分分钟被骂到退市；王自如称「想与罗永浩和解」 ；OpenAI透露人形机器人项目进展</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/zaobao/DlLESyleeLkyq5Dy.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" nodeleaf=""></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>要闻提示</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mve2tdgd11ay" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;">1.特斯拉飞行汽车被质疑是噱头！网友：若是国内厂商，分分钟被骂到退市</section><section style="text-align: justify;">2.加价大几千买iPhone Duo消费者发声：想成为朋友圈第一个用上的人</section><section style="text-align: justify;">3.王自如称“想与罗永浩和解”</section><section style="text-align: justify;">4.DeepSeek V4.1 Flash新版本发布！网友怒赞：太上进，超级斩杀线</section><section style="text-align: justify;">5.比亚迪第三代秦 PLUS 实车曝光，预计 10 月下旬上市</section><section style="text-align: justify;">6.英伟达优化 Kimi K3 模型推理速度，提升 1.68 倍</section><section style="text-align: justify;">7.京东：未来 5 年将创造超 10 万个机器人维修工程师就业岗位</section><p style="text-align: justify;">8.OpenAI 将研发人形机器人，奥尔特曼称核心是打造“大脑”</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>今日头条</strong></span></p></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mmxst4fs1xis" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam1od114ht" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>特斯拉飞行汽车被质疑是噱头！网友：若是国内厂商，分分钟被骂到退市</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，日前，特斯拉正式发布新一代纯电超跑Roadster，凭借凌空倒挂、原地起飞、空中翻转等一系列惊人特技引发关注。不过，这款号称能够“飞起来”的超级跑车，也因实际使用场景和法规限制受到质疑，相关话题“特斯拉飞行汽车被质疑是噱头”登上热搜引发热议。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据国内媒体报道，不少业内人士认为，Roadster虽然展示了惊人的工程技术，但这些特殊功能在实际使用中仍面临场景和法规限制，所谓“飞行汽车”可能更多是一种噱头。毕竟，短暂腾空和空中翻转并不意味着车辆具备持续飞行能力，与真正能够用于日常出行的飞行汽车仍有明显区别。此外，特斯拉的这款车辆归谁管目前尚未有明确答案。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">有网友犀利调侃称：“这款特斯拉第二代Roadster纯电超跑，实际用途不如国产新能源的冰箱彩电大沙发。”还有网友称：“特斯拉Roadster要换作是国内任何一家上市厂商发布，分分钟被骂到退市。”也有博主表示，往汽车壳子装了气体推进装置，在短时间内控制它在空中翻转几下，然后美其名曰“飞行汽车”，“这飞的哪门子行？”（快科技、鞭牛士）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ed6678cc-2061-475a-871f-ba406e60ab8d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:4590,&quot;width&quot;:3733,&quot;currHeight&quot;:4590,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3733,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:4590,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3733,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FM1OibLOpKovBqFxAByxc2nOfnHg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;M1OibLOpKovBqFxAByxc2nOfnHg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1241663,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad574046cd9e.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.22890625" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1280" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="3733" data-height="4590" data-backw="578" data-backh="710" data-imgfileid="504274600" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad574046cd9e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9svywoj9j" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>国内资讯</strong></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>加价大几千买iPhone Duo消费者发声：想成为朋友圈第一个用上的人</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，起售价15999元的iPhone Duo火爆程度远超所有人预期，10月16日预售开启不到30分钟，全球多地的 iPhone Duo 预计发货日期就已经排到1月25日左右。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">值得注意的是，消费者明明可以等几个月原价买到新机，但还是有人愿意加价大几千甚至上万元，专门去抢首批现货的iPhone Duo。一位成都消费者透露，自己连续刷了三天抢购通道，最后加价五千多拿下了256GB黑色版本，核心诉求就是想成为自己朋友圈里第一个用上折叠屏iPhone的人，对他来说首批现货的稀缺感本身就已经值回票价。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">抱着类似想法的消费者不在少数，相比产品本身的实用属性，加价抢首发能获得的社交圈层情绪价值，才是驱动这批人愿意付出高额溢价的核心原动力。消费电子行业分析师表示，苹果首款折叠屏首秀就出现超高溢价完全在意料之内，本质是首发阶段短期供需错配带来的正常市场现象。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3c2041e6-8394-4e56-9e34-6b3a146d7be5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:449,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;currHeight&quot;:449,&quot;currWidth&quot;:600,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:449,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCwbgbYPCyo2of9xE9jIcQDLXn6e%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CwbgbYPCyo2of9xE9jIcQDLXn6e&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:127882,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57404acb31.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7483333333333333" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="449" data-backw="578" data-backh="433" data-imgfileid="504274602" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57404acb31.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve2z78ve6g" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>王自如称“想与罗永浩和解”</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，据报道，在微博 V 影响力大会科技论坛上，王自如就“再给一次机会，是否还会和罗永浩吵架”作出回应。他表示：“我下次可能就是十字路口了吧，借微博喊话，不吵了和解了。如果你想吵架成为大 V 的话，输赢并不重要，比如我是吧。”</p><p style="text-align: justify;">2014 年 8 月，王自如与罗永浩的一场直播交锋轰动互联网，核心围绕锤子手机 T1 的评测争议展开，起因是王自如的测评机构 ZEALER 发布锤子 T1 评测视频，指出手机存在屏幕易碎、散热设计缺陷、品控不稳定等问题。罗永浩认为评测存在事实错误和恶意倾向，公开约战王自如直播对质。在直播中，罗永浩逐条反驳王自如的评测结论，王自如全程被动，被罗永浩现场压制。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">当年报道，王自如后续于 9 月 1 日发布《致歉 &amp; 声明》称，“我们要为 T1 测评视频当中的技术错误和语言表达错误道歉”，“我们要对视频素材拍摄当中存在的不严谨，以及由此可能引发的误导进行道歉”，“我要向一直支持 ZEALER 的朋友们道歉”，“作为团队的负责人，我要向 ZEALER 的每一个成员道歉”。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1d813e4e-4a34-4704-96ea-93399e47d025&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:261.49963950973324,&quot;width&quot;:450,&quot;currHeight&quot;:261.49963950973324,&quot;currWidth&quot;:450,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:806,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1387,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32444124008651765,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFOtfb9pdxoOs8GxPD8QcR9NBnNb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FOtfb9pdxoOs8GxPD8QcR9NBnNb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:338080,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57404d0b98.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5805555555555556" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1387" data-height="806" data-backw="578" data-backh="336" data-imgfileid="504274601" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57404d0b98.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve2zusg1gtb" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>DeepSeek V4.1 Flash新版本发布！网友怒赞：太上进，超级斩杀线</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，日前，据DeepSeek官方公众号，DeepSeek V4.1 Flash现已更新至V4.1-Flash-1017版本，官方网页端、APP与API模型已同步变更为新模型。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据官方介绍，DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017通过基于自反馈的强化学习（RL）训练技术，提升了在游戏开发、3D建模等方面从零开始构建完整项目的能力，能够支持实现更多“许愿式”编程任务及项目开发请求。且实测表明，多数场景下Token用量较前版下降逾50%。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">不仅如此，本次新版本发布 DeepSeek API 新增对 Search 与 Fetch 接口的支持，相关能力正式向公众开放。据了解，两个接口价格均为5元 / 千次。DeepSeek V4.1 Flash新版本上线后，评论区网友怒赞刷屏，有网友调侃“我就是知道，你那天挂机就是背着我们偷偷进步。太上进了”，还有网友直呼，“ x x什么超级斩杀线”。（快科技、新浪科技）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d4c014b8-4d28-4c89-9623-b5dab09ffda9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:408.47999999999996,&quot;width&quot;:413.99999999999994,&quot;currHeight&quot;:408.47999999999996,&quot;currWidth&quot;:413.99999999999994,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:592,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.69,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLp8XbQJ5To3NkZx8t6vcxUzFnRb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Lp8XbQJ5To3NkZx8t6vcxUzFnRb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:129903,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad574050de0b.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9866666666666667" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="592" data-backw="578" data-backh="570" data-imgfileid="504274603" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad574050de0b.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve30y5ejdr" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>比亚迪第三代秦 PLUS 实车曝光，预计 10 月下旬上市</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，小红书博主 @战神之音分享了比亚迪第三代秦 PLUS 实车外观，该车已经公布官图并完成工信部申报，预计 10 月下旬上市。据悉，比亚迪王朝网销售事业部总经理路天此前对这款新车进行了预热，该车“尺寸更大，空间更大，想象更大”，更多关于它的信息将会陆续发布。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">申报信息显示，比亚迪秦 PLUS EV 为纯电动轿车，由比亚迪汽车工业有限公司申报，车身外形尺寸为长 4840 mm、宽 1900 mm、高 1498 mm，轴距达到 2800 mm。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">动力方面，该车搭载永磁同步驱动电机，型号为 TZ164XYD，由抚州比亚迪实业有限公司生产，峰值功率 100 kW，额定功率 40 kW；储能装置为磷酸铁锂蓄电池，电池单体由贵阳弗迪电池有限公司生产，电池总成由襄阳弗迪电池有限公司生产，防抱死制动系统由弗迪动力有限公司提供，型号为 IPB (FD)。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9cc18ce3-e07a-4db2-854e-097f35fb4f4b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:495.2808988764045,&quot;width&quot;:456,&quot;currHeight&quot;:495.2808988764045,&quot;currWidth&quot;:456,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1160,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1068,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.42696629213483145,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYGLsbw2wporXvOxt4iAcj9qUnac%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YGLsbw2wporXvOxt4iAcj9qUnac&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:377163,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5740533af1.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0861423220973783" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1068" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1068" data-height="1160" data-backw="578" data-backh="628" data-imgfileid="504274604" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5740533af1.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve31ob7o86" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>英伟达优化 Kimi K3 模型推理速度，提升 1.68 倍</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，据外媒报道，英伟达通过一项上游 vLLM 优化，让 2.8 万亿参数量的 Kimi K3 模型实现 423 tok/s/user（每用户每秒每 Token）的推理速度，对比相同硬件（GB300 NVL72）性能提升 1.68 倍。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据介绍，该项优化由英伟达 CentML 工程师 Benjamin 完成。它通过大规模 Megakernel 融合，使用 Cute DSL 编写英伟达新推出的解码专用内核。该 Megakernel 包含 1.2 万行代码，代表着 AI 辅助生成高级计算内核的未来方向。英伟达优化 Kimi K3 模型推理速度，提升 1.68 倍。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据了解，英伟达除此之外，还在为 vLLM 开发 DeepSeek V4.1 等其他模型的优化。（IT之家）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;45c9223f-fe23-44e0-acfe-f5fcd5520d1a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:633.120267260579,&quot;width&quot;:394,&quot;currHeight&quot;:633.120267260579,&quot;currWidth&quot;:394,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1443,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:898,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.43875278396436523,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBt5Ubh3Kho1M2cxzlfYcGHNanbg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Bt5Ubh3Kho1M2cxzlfYcGHNanbg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:781644,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad574055fe57.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.6069042316258353" data-type="jpeg" data-w="898" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="898" data-height="1443" data-backw="578" data-backh="929" data-imgfileid="504274605" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad574055fe57.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve32fzsr6h" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>字节跳动CFO 高准，上榜2026年「亚洲最具影响力商界女性」</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，全球顶级财经媒体《财富》(Fortune)，于近期公布2026年「亚洲最具影响力的商界女性Most Powerful Women Asia」榜单，表彰100位凭借出色的领导力、企业经营表现及个人影响力，推动区域经济未来发展的女性。字节跳动CFO高准（Julie Gao）再次上榜，排在第15位（2025年排名第16位，2024年排名第53位）。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">高准，先后获北京大学法学学士、阿拉巴马大学社会学硕士、加州大学洛杉矶分校法学博士。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">高准，于2022年4月加入字节跳动、出任首席财务官(CFO)。投资者称赞她是一位坦诚、乐于沟通、能倾听需求的首席财务官。在加入字节跳动之前，高准曾从事律师逾20年，她是世达国际律师事务所高级合伙人，是IPO顶级律师。她的律师生涯中曾帮助一系列中国科技巨头上市，包括京东、拼多多、小米、美团等。（瑞恩资本RyanbenCapital）</p><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve33h5g1f1m" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>DeepSeek将整合多团队成立产品部，崔添翼出任负责人</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>10月18日消息，据媒体报道，近日，DeepSeek将Harness团队以及Web、App、Platform团队整合成“产品部”，负责公司所有的产品、设计和研发工作，原Harness团队负责人崔添翼任产品部负责人。目前，产品部对外招聘产品设计师和设计师岗位。（科创板日报）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>博主曝华为将推子品牌「星芒」手机将主攻线上</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，日前，数码博主“数码闲聊站”透露，华为全新子品牌“星芒”手机将主攻线上，定位相对有性价比，目前已经规划了好几款新机，其中还有搭载主动散热风扇的版本。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">近期，多方传闻都提到，华为有望推出全新手机子品牌，命名为星芒。有数码博主爆料称，星芒定位对标早年荣耀，主打1799至4000元中端性价比市场，预计今年11月亮相首款机型。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>商标记录显示，华为技术有限公司很早便申请“星芒”相关商标，2020年、2023年申请的多枚“星芒”商标已经成功注册；2026年7月，华为再次提交新的“星芒”商标申请，目前状态为“注册申请中”，商标覆盖品类，包含电子设备、通讯相关领域。（鞭牛士）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>网传“重庆一车辆从 60 米高架桥坠落”引关注，官方核实系谣言</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，近日，有网民在互联网平台发布一则视频并配文称“2026 年 10 月 15 日，重庆武隆高架桥 60 米坠落，驾驶员仅受轻伤奇迹生还”，引发关注。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据“重庆辟谣”微信公众号、网信武隆消息，网传信息系谣言。经向武隆区公安局核实，该区近期未发生相关事件，网传信息不实。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">据悉，经多方溯源，网传视频中车祸画面系往年外省多个交通事故的现场画面，视频为剪辑拼接，并非同一场事故。目前，警方正对造谣者展开调查。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a297d95c-1cc2-419f-966f-477e3f8d8280&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:475.02702702702703,&quot;width&quot;:312,&quot;currHeight&quot;:475.02702702702703,&quot;currWidth&quot;:312,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1352,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:888,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.35135135135135137,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCnr3bvle9o9te8xJKVtcCdMOnTe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Cnr3bvle9o9te8xJKVtcCdMOnTe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:115664,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5740589df9.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.5225225225225225" data-type="jpeg" data-w="888" style="background-color: transparent;width: 223px;height: 340px;" data-width="888" data-height="1352" data-imgfileid="504274608" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5740589df9.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve34nee1fcb" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>理想汽车芯片子公司完成首轮16.25亿元融资协议</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，理想汽车日前宣布，旗下芯片子公司上海马赫心科技有限公司签署首轮股权融资协议，融资金额为16.25亿元人民币。本轮融资由杭州经韬、蓝驰创投及华业天成领投，奇绩创坛参与投资。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">同时，杭州经韬及其关联基金获授最高5亿元人民币的追加认购权，若该认购权悉数行使，投后估值达171亿元。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>此次融资将支持马赫心科技持续推进芯片研发与商业化，把握更广泛的产业机遇，尤其是在非汽车领域，推动理想汽车在芯片及域控制器领域的长远发展。（三言科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>杭州具身大脑创企融资近亿，多家国资投了</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，据媒体报道，杭州具身大脑企业格物通智宣布完成近亿元天使轮融资，投资方包括鸿富资产、匹克投资、杭州资本、杭州人才集团、某省级具身产投及多家头部上市公司。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据悉，本轮融资资金将主要用于物理反演世界模型的大规模预训练与技术迭代、硬件与本体构建等，加快人才引进和规模扩充，并推进多个场景PoC验证和真实数据采集。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>格物通智成立于2026年，面向真实产业场景研发自进化的灵巧操作智能，致力于通过“世界模型+PSI物理自进化”技术体系，为机器人提供有“手感”的具身大脑。该公司提出了“物理反演世界模型”，让机器人从看得见的动作中推断接触、受力等隐含物理信息，用于大规模预训练。（机器人前瞻）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>曝华为 Pura X Max 阔折叠手机销量已破百万台，标准版成功“赶超”典藏版</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，长期关注国内手机市场份额的博主 @RD观测 分享了华为折叠屏手机的销量情况：截至 2026 W40（9 月 28 日-10 月 4 日），华为 Pura X Max 约 52.9 万台、Pura X Max 典藏版约 49.31 万台。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">从数据来看，华为 Pura X Max 系列横向阔折叠手机的总销量已突破百万台。值得一提的是，普通版终于实现了对典藏版的销量“赶超”，并拉开了约 3.59 万台的差距（此前典藏版的销量长期高于普通版）。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">此前报道，行业首款横向阔折叠手机 —— 华为 Pura X Max 已于今年 4 月 25 日 10:08 开售，全系搭载麒麟 9030 Pro 旗舰处理器，售价 10999 元起。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e2e0f0a0-1858-4be2-85bf-d5cc8bfd61ce&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:184.8046875,&quot;width&quot;:456,&quot;currHeight&quot;:184.8046875,&quot;currWidth&quot;:456,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:415,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1024,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.4453125,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVS6vbAuK3omY8FxLnqPckpNVnxh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VS6vbAuK3omY8FxLnqPckpNVnxh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:26178,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57405a84e2.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4052734375" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1024" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1024" data-height="415" data-backw="578" data-backh="234" data-imgfileid="504274606" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57405a84e2.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve36g9z10ma" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>京东：未来 5 年将创造超 10 万个机器人维修工程师就业岗位</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，据报道，在京东推出机器人维修售后服务一年之际，京东已经与智元、云深处、众擎、松延动力等近百家机器人企业达成售后维修服务合作，涵盖几乎所有头部机器人企业。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">京东对外公布机器人售后相关规划，未来5年，计划创造超过10万个机器人维修工程师的就业岗位，搭建面向全球的机器人维保服务网络。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">与此同时，京东还将持续推进以快递员为代表的物流一线员工转型机器人维修工程师，通过系统化培训与实战历练，打造一支高素质、专业化的机器人维修队伍，助力一线员工职业转型。（快科技）</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国际资讯</strong></span></p></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam15q08cj"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve3a0siom5" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>OpenAI 将研发人形机器人，奥尔特曼称核心是打造“大脑”</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日消息，尽管 OpenAI 已经忙于开发人工智能模型和全新消费级硬件，但首席执行官萨姆 · 奥尔特曼及其团队显然还有精力推进另一个项目：人形机器人。奥尔特曼在播客节目中解释，选择人形具备合理性，原因是“这个世界本身就是为人类设计的”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">被问到 OpenAI 是否会亲自制造人形机器人时，他的回答十分简洁：“我们会。”不过奥尔特曼并不十分在意机器人外观这类细碎细节。他称，这些问题“远不如真正研发出驱动机器人运转的‘大脑’重要”。简单来讲，如果一台机器不知道如何运用四肢，就算给它装上双臂双腿，也难以发挥作用。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">据了解，该项目距离成为正式产品还有很长一段路。奥尔特曼此前曾表示：“我预计我们会在 2027 年拿出亮眼的演示样机…… 但机器人走上街头还需要再等好几年。”（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;794c6f7b-1c24-41d8-b1f5-e01375912dbe&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:277.4,&quot;width&quot;:494,&quot;currHeight&quot;:277.4,&quot;currWidth&quot;:494,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:438,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:780,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.6333333333333333,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQCtMbfprio9Kw1xsQMYcEPsenBf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QCtMbfprio9Kw1xsQMYcEPsenBf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:254566,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57405ee9a8.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5615384615384615" data-type="jpeg" data-w="780" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="780" data-height="438" data-backw="578" data-backh="325" data-imgfileid="504274609" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57405ee9a8.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvei84tk553"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>英特尔陈立武：美中芯片各有优劣势，差距没想象大</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，英特尔CEO陈立武在接受专访时指出，美国政府虽然在英特尔持有少数股权，但对公司治理并无任何影响。他还提到，英特尔的重组工作已完成8成，至于美中芯片差距并没有想象中那么大。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">陈立武强调，美国政府并没有利用其少数股权干预英特尔的商业策略，并坚称公司依然保有独立性。去年，美国政府将此前拨付的联邦资金转为对英特尔89亿美元的投资，从而获得该公司9.9%的股权。今年8月，英特尔进行二次股票发行后，美国政府持股比例被稀释至约8.2%。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>谈到中国大陆半导体业的发展时，陈立武认为，美国与中国大陆企业“有各自的优劣势”。然而，当被问及中国大陆芯片制造能力能否在5到10年内追上美国时，他说：“就目前而言，我认为差距并不大。”（快科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>RTX 5090真要停产停售吗：英伟达回应了！</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月17日消息，近日，英伟达个人计算业务高级副总裁Jeff Fisher在出席活动时，专门正面回应了近期流传的RTX 5090停产相关传闻，直接明确表示相关消息完全不属实。他特意强调，RTX 5090目前仍是英伟达产品线里非常重要的核心旗舰级消费级产品，后续品牌会继续面向全球市场稳定供货。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">不过他也同时承认，当前这款显卡的供应链产能确实受到不小限制，英伟达正在全力协调资源推动产品尽快补满市场供需。这位高管直言，如果早年没有深耕游戏显卡业务、没有推出GeForce系列产品线，就不会有今天的英伟达。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">此前，英伟达美国官方官网悄然下架了RTX 5090旗舰显卡的商品页，进一步加剧了外界关于它已经全面停产、甚至英伟达要直接把高端消费级产品线砍掉的各类猜测。据统计，国内32GB版RTX 5090的价格从9月初的约3.5万元涨至10月14日的5.4万元左右，涨幅超过50%。德国市场均价超过6000欧元，较一年前暴涨132%。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c8e4c302-4845-437b-9a9b-221ae1ae6fa1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:221.33333333333334,&quot;width&quot;:332,&quot;currHeight&quot;:221.33333333333334,&quot;currWidth&quot;:332,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:400,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.5533333333333333,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNvvebjcP6o61rvxaW3EcLsAXnRb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NvvebjcP6o61rvxaW3EcLsAXnRb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:166910,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5740620107.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="400" data-backw="578" data-backh="385" data-imgfileid="504274610" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5740620107.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve39hklvmr" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>马斯克盯上了砍价生意，号称一年为全球省下6万亿美元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月18日消息，当地时间10月16日，特斯拉创始人马斯克在社交平台发文称，团队正投入大量资源，开发面向商业场景的专用议价机器人（Hagglebot）。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">马斯克表示，“我们认为该产品能够将企业成本效率提升5%乃至更高。如果放到全球GDP的维度测算，每年可节省的成本规模最高可达6万亿美元。”他还进一步指出，凡是使用Grok的企业，都能获得立即可量化的竞争优势。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">需要注意的是，Hagglebot只是依托Grok打造的软件AI Bot，并不是Optimus那种实体人形机器人。它主打企业议价场景，和普通对话AI定位完全不同。目前马斯克没有放出太多细节，这套AI具体怎么议价、支持哪些交易场景、何时上线、怎么收费，都还没有官宣。另一边，特斯拉的实体人形机器人Optimus擎天柱，仍在小批量内部试产。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1a9a6f3a-7263-4f88-bdf0-8d3c66a96535&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:426,&quot;width&quot;:596,&quot;currHeight&quot;:426,&quot;currWidth&quot;:596,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:426,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:596,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVq1Qb0LBZoR08WxaDoDcNLE5nih%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Vq1Qb0LBZoR08WxaDoDcNLE5nih&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:225875,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57406556de.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.714765100671141" data-type="png" data-w="596" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="596" data-height="426" data-backw="578" data-backh="413" data-imgfileid="504274611" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad57406556de.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mve3ao6916vh" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>AI 编程神器出事了！OpenCode 遭入侵，API 密钥恐泄露</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 18 日，开源 AI 编程工具 OpenCode 披露，发生一起与大规模模型蒸馏攻击有关的安全事件，影响了约 1.4% 的 OpenCode Console 用户。OpenCode Console 是该项目提供的在线服务，与本地运行的 OpenCode 编程工具有所区别。此次事件涉及关联了外部 AI 模型服务商账户的部分 Console 用户，并非所有 OpenCode 用户。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">根据受影响用户公开的通知邮件，OpenCode 发现一套正在停用的旧系统遭到未经授权访问，保存在用户工作区中的第三方 AI 服务 API 密钥可能泄露，包括 OpenAI、Anthropic 等服务商的密钥。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">OpenCode 表示，目前尚无法确认相关密钥是否遭到恶意使用，初步调查也未发现其他数据泄露的证据。其还在与相关 AI 服务商讨论异常费用的退款问题，但尚未作出退款承诺。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">与此同时，部分用户反映出现异常 API 使用情况。其中一名用户表示，收到 OpenCode 的安全通知时，还收到了 Anthropic 发来的邮件，显示其当月 20 美元的 API 额度已经耗尽。目前，安全事件仍在处理中，OpenCode 正与 Anthropic、OpenAI 和 Google 合作开展补救工作。（云头条）</section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
